    /// The camera's distance to the focal point at the end of the move, relative to the captured distance: 0.5 halves it (an approach), 2 doubles it (a retreat), 1 keeps it. Between 0.05 and 20. Appended in Model 0.4.0.
    std::optional<double> dolly_factor;
    /// Whether the move sways back and forth around the captured framing (a seamless rocking loop: every component follows sin(2πi/N) / 2 of its total) instead of progressing from the captured framing to the full move. Appended in Model 0.4.0.
